### Banking Transactions API — Sample Requests
### Compatible with: VS Code REST Client, JetBrains HTTP Client
### Start the app first: bash demo/run-docker.sh  (or run-local.sh)

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080


### ==============================================================
### CREATE TRANSACTIONS
### ==============================================================

### 1. Deposit — fund ACC-12345 with USD
# @name deposit1
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fromAccount": "ACC-EXT01",
  "toAccount": "ACC-12345",
  "amount": 1500.00,
  "currency": "USD",
  "type": "deposit",
  "status": "completed"
}

### 2. Deposit — fund ACC-67890 with EUR
# @name deposit2
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fromAccount": "ACC-EXT02",
  "toAccount": "ACC-67890",
  "amount": 800.50,
  "currency": "EUR",
  "type": "deposit",
  "status": "completed"
}

### 3. Deposit — fund ACC-ABCDE with JPY
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fromAccount": "ACC-EXT03",
  "toAccount": "ACC-ABCDE",
  "amount": 150000.00,
  "currency": "JPY",
  "type": "deposit",
  "status": "completed"
}

### 4. Transfer from ACC-12345 to ACC-67890 in GBP
# @name transfer1
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fromAccount": "ACC-12345",
  "toAccount": "ACC-67890",
  "amount": 175.00,
  "currency": "GBP",
  "type": "transfer",
  "status": "completed"
}

### 5. Transfer from ACC-67890 to ACC-ABCDE in SGD
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fromAccount": "ACC-67890",
  "toAccount": "ACC-ABCDE",
  "amount": 320.00,
  "currency": "SGD",
  "type": "transfer",
  "status": "completed"
}

### 6. Withdrawal from ACC-12345 in CAD
# @name withdrawal1
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fromAccount": "ACC-12345",
  "toAccount": "ACC-EXT01",
  "amount": 200.00,
  "currency": "CAD",
  "type": "withdrawal",
  "status": "completed"
}

### 7. Withdrawal from ACC-ABCDE in JPY
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fromAccount": "ACC-ABCDE",
  "toAccount": "ACC-EXT03",
  "amount": 25000.00,
  "currency": "JPY",
  "type": "withdrawal",
  "status": "completed"
}

### 8. Pending transfer in CHF
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fromAccount": "ACC-67890",
  "toAccount": "ACC-12345",
  "amount": 90.00,
  "currency": "CHF",
  "type": "transfer",
  "status": "pending"
}

### 9. Failed withdrawal in AUD
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fromAccount": "ACC-12345",
  "toAccount": "ACC-EXT04",
  "amount": 500.00,
  "currency": "AUD",
  "type": "withdrawal",
  "status": "failed"
}


### ==============================================================
### GET ALL TRANSACTIONS — no filters
### ==============================================================

### 10. List all transactions
GET {{baseUrl}}/transactions


### ==============================================================
### GET TRANSACTIONS — filters
### ==============================================================

### 11. Filter by accountId — all transactions touching ACC-12345
GET {{baseUrl}}/transactions?accountId=ACC-12345

### 12. Filter by type — all transfers
GET {{baseUrl}}/transactions?type=transfer

### 13. Filter by type — all deposits
GET {{baseUrl}}/transactions?type=deposit

### 14. Filter by date range (adjust dates to today's date)
GET {{baseUrl}}/transactions?from=2026-01-01&to=2026-12-31

### 15. Combined filters — transfers for ACC-12345 in date range
GET {{baseUrl}}/transactions?accountId=ACC-12345&type=transfer&from=2026-01-01&to=2026-12-31


### ==============================================================
### GET TRANSACTION BY ID
### ==============================================================

### 16. Get transaction by ID — replace <id> with an id from responses above
GET {{baseUrl}}/transactions/<id>

### 17. Get transaction — non-existent ID (expect 404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/transactions/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000


### ==============================================================
### ACCOUNT BALANCE — with currency conversion
### ==============================================================

### 18. Balance for ACC-12345 in USD (default)
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts/ACC-12345/balance

### 19. Balance for ACC-12345 converted to EUR
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts/ACC-12345/balance?currency=EUR

### 20. Balance for ACC-12345 converted to JPY
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts/ACC-12345/balance?currency=JPY

### 21. Balance for ACC-67890 in USD (default)
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts/ACC-67890/balance

### 22. Balance for ACC-67890 converted to GBP
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts/ACC-67890/balance?currency=GBP

### 23. Balance for ACC-ABCDE in JPY (native currency)
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts/ACC-ABCDE/balance?currency=JPY

### 24. Balance for ACC-ABCDE converted to USD
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts/ACC-ABCDE/balance?currency=USD

### 25. Balance — unsupported conversion currency (expect 400)
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts/ACC-12345/balance?currency=XYZ

### 26. Balance — non-existent account (expect 404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts/ACC-ZZZZZ/balance


### ==============================================================
### ACCOUNT SUMMARY
### ==============================================================

### 27. Summary for ACC-12345
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts/ACC-12345/summary

### 28. Summary for ACC-67890
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts/ACC-67890/summary

### 29. Summary for ACC-ABCDE
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts/ACC-ABCDE/summary

### 30. Summary — non-existent account (expect 404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts/ACC-ZZZZZ/summary


### ==============================================================
### VALIDATION ERRORS
### ==============================================================

### 31. Missing all fields (expect 400 with full details list)
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 32. Invalid amount — zero (expect 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fromAccount": "ACC-12345",
  "toAccount": "ACC-67890",
  "amount": 0,
  "currency": "USD",
  "type": "transfer",
  "status": "completed"
}

### 33. Invalid amount — more than 2 decimal places (expect 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fromAccount": "ACC-12345",
  "toAccount": "ACC-67890",
  "amount": 10.999,
  "currency": "EUR",
  "type": "transfer",
  "status": "completed"
}

### 34. Invalid account format (expect 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fromAccount": "INVALID",
  "toAccount": "ACC-67890",
  "amount": 100.00,
  "currency": "GBP",
  "type": "transfer",
  "status": "completed"
}

### 35. Invalid currency code (expect 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fromAccount": "ACC-12345",
  "toAccount": "ACC-67890",
  "amount": 100.00,
  "currency": "XXX",
  "type": "transfer",
  "status": "completed"
}

### 36. Invalid type (expect 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fromAccount": "ACC-12345",
  "toAccount": "ACC-67890",
  "amount": 100.00,
  "currency": "JPY",
  "type": "wire",
  "status": "completed"
}

### 37. Invalid status (expect 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fromAccount": "ACC-12345",
  "toAccount": "ACC-67890",
  "amount": 100.00,
  "currency": "CAD",
  "type": "transfer",
  "status": "processing"
}

### 38. Multiple validation errors at once (expect 400 with multiple details)
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fromAccount": "BAD",
  "toAccount": "ALSO-BAD",
  "amount": -50,
  "currency": "FAKE",
  "type": "unknown",
  "status": "nope"
}
